msgctxt "OrchardCore.AzureAI.Handlers.AzureAISearchIndexProfileHandler"
msgid "Invalid index name. Must start with a letter and be 1–128 characters long. Only letters, numbers, and underscores are allowed. Names cannot begin with 'azureSearch'."
